sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant E as WAF / API / BFF
  participant X as Advisor Context Service
  participant R as Bank Eligibility Rules
  participant A as AI Advisor
  C->>E: Request financial advice
  E->>X: Authenticated purpose-limited request
  X->>R: Evaluate product eligibility
  R-->>X: Eligible product candidates
  X-->>A: Curated snapshot + provenance
  A-->>E: Ranked advice and explanations
  E-->>C: Advisory response + disclosures
  Note over A: No direct CBS or ODS access
  Note over R,A: Bank rules decide; AI recommends

